Unofficial Korean translation of Velo Tools Tutorial Handbook v1.7.1.
Source: https://github.com/visaokc/Velo-Tools/blob/main/docs/user-manual.en.md
Retrieved and translated: 2026-09-15.
Changes: English prose translated into Korean; UI identifiers retained; PDF cover, table of contents, bookmarks, and links added.
Original project: visaokc/Velo-Tools. Repository license: GNU GPL version 3; see LICENSE.txt.
Korean and English editable Markdown sources are attached.

